{"availability":"available","full":"bradleyhomelinuxnet-prog/natori-on-psyfr","name":"natori-on-psyfr","description":"The serpent that rings the egg of time. A predictive chronology engine + field guide rendering Jason Breshears' Archaix thesis as living calendrics — 138 lattice · 19 metonic · palindromic mirror. Self-contained, air-gap friendly.","category":"Productivity","language":"HTML","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-01T23:28:51Z","updated":"2026-10-08T05:38:11Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://bradleyhomelinuxnet-prog.github.io/natori-on-psyfr/","topics":["archaix","chronology","date-picker","date-projection","github-pages","metonic-19","palindrome","phoenix-138","predictive-calendar","worldbuilding"],"demo":"https://bradleyhomelinuxnet-prog.github.io/natori-on-psyfr/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T02:05:29.261Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T02:05:29.261Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T02:05:29.261Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T18:26:08.323Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T06:13:13.603Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-12T02:05:29.261Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A ground-up rebuild of Ophis v12 — Jason M. Breshears' date-projection instrument — reverse engineered from the shipped Windows application with the owner's permission, and verified bit-exact against it.","Give it two or more dates on which similar events occurred. It measures the distance between every pair of them in axial rotations of the Earth, runs each distance through a table of sixteen operations, projects the results forward, and filters out the projections that bear no arithmetic relationship to the controls.","Nothing leaves the page. There is no network call, no sign-in, and no dependency."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bradleyhomelinuxnet-prog/natori-on-psyfr/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"fc11d588c5d01a03c734079080bbeb6e2436c879edb62d08596f1f8d9c9e58f9","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T18:26:08.433Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T02:05:29.398Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A ground-up rebuild of Ophis v12 — Jason M. Breshears' date-projection instrument — reverse engineered from the shipped Windows application with the owner's permission, and verified bit-exact against it.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bradleyhomelinuxnet-prog/natori-on-psyfr/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"There is no network call, no sign-in, and no dependency.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bradleyhomelinuxnet-prog/natori-on-psyfr/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"What is deliberately different — no eval, no arbitrary-path writes, no sign-in theatre, and \"today\" read from the clock rather than baked in — is listed in docs/DEVIATIONS.md.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bradleyhomelinuxnet-prog/natori-on-psyfr/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"fc11d588c5d01a03c734079080bbeb6e2436c879edb62d08596f1f8d9c9e58f9","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bradleyhomelinuxnet-prog/natori-on-psyfr/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T02:05:29.398Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T05:38:11Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bradleyhomelinuxnet-prog/natori-on-psyfr/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T02:05:29.399Z","hash":"fc11d588c5d01a03c734079080bbeb6e2436c879edb62d08596f1f8d9c9e58f9","originalBytes":10630,"storedBytes":10630,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T02:05:29.261Z","subjects":[],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Productivity","subjects":[],"evidence":[],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":[],"reviewRequired":false},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://bradleyhomelinuxnet-prog.github.io/natori-on-psyfr/","attemptedAt":"2026-